      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Framing a 5% increase as \"initial success\" with room for \"significant scaling\" is deceptive and will likely disqualify your application for funds explicitly tied to \"proven impact.\" If you lie or fabricate success on the draft you are using, you risk legal consequences and damage that is hard to repair. I recommend immediately adjusting your narrative to honestly focus on the strategic value of the 5% uplift while highlighting the specific, verifiable methods you will deploy to hit the 20% target in future phases.",
